Rambo: First Blood Part II was released on May 22, 1985, by Tri-Star Pictures, becoming a major global blockbuster, with an estimated box office gross of $150
million in the United States, becoming the second highest grossing film at the domestic box office and the third highest grossing film worldwide in 1985.

19
01:07:33,333 --> 01:07:39,333
